  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A more Equitable Society: Promoting Social Cohesion and Diversity in Bosnia and Herzegovina (Dialogue for Future 3- DFF3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching goal of this project is to contribute to strengthening social cohesion, respect fordiversity, understanding and trust, especially amongst young men and women in differentcommunities, towards a more democratic and peaceful Bosnia and Herzegovina. The proposedintervention would support progress towards reconciliation and strengthened positiverelationships within and across communities, (i) by creating an enabling environment forinclusive dialogue and progressing dialogue on key iss</narrative>
  </description>
